{"author":{"id":"98a8d196af4b3b3a11b496a622c3857deea61c7fcfd81ca5bb36f1f18227ef6b"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795286979,"nonce":"7EbXDQ3uJBj6eYelUu6N2d+I5Xo=","title":"Flares defend a plane against missiles","message":"\u003e We need to add flares to defend against missiles. We should also pull in game assets from separate branches and keep reading git bug. We also want full screen, \"fuller\" HUD, etc. We have various plane models (players model up planes as they rack up kills) on another branch, but they are not currently destructible. If feasible, deconstruct models into pieces that fit the current model. Current model: destroyed wings or fuselage should be a very quick crash. Add assets (audio, terrain, planes, etc.) as they arrive on different branches. Terrain features need collision detection too.\n\n**Outcome.** A pilot releases a flare with a key. A missile that follows the plane and sees the flare follows the flare instead. A plane carries a few flares, and they fill again slowly. Every machine sees the flare. Bots use flares.\n\n**Done when.** Tests of the rules show that a flare in time saves a plane from a missile that would hit it, that a plane without flares is hit, and that every machine sees the flare. A browser test releases a flare with its key.\n\nBelongs to the plan, issue 1d9449d.\n\nAgent: Claude Fable 5.2","files":null}]}